i Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["gāya gorā madhur svare"],"translation":["Gaurasundar sings in a sweet voice:"],"isLong":false},{"text":["“hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare","hare rāma hare rāma rāma rāma hare hare”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["gṛhe thāka, vane thāka","sadā ‘hari’ bale’ ḍāka","sukhe duḥkhe bhulo nāka","vadane hari-nām kara re"],"translation":["Stay at home, or stay in a forest, regardless, always call out ‘Hari!’ In happiness and in sadness, don’t forget: chant the Lord’s Name aloud."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["māyā-jāle baddha ha’ye","āchha michhe kāja la’ye","ekhan-o chetana peye","rādhā-mādhav-nām bala re"],"translation":["Bound in Māyā’s net, you work in vain. Now, while you are still conscious, chant ‘Rādhā-Mādhava’."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["jīvana ha-ila śeṣa","nā bhajile hṛṣīkeśa","bhaktivinod-upadeśa","ek-bār nām-rase māta re"],"translation":["Your life is ending, but you have not served Hṛṣīkeś. Bhakti Vinod advises: once relish His Name’s nectar."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura-1","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gay-gaura-madhura-sware","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gai-gora-madxur","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śrī-Nāma-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/gay-gora-madhur-svare/","description":"Śrī Nāma — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śrī Nāma. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"gay-gora-madhur-svare"}}